  "details": "When a world has a baked shadowmask, it completely replaces any dynamic shadows in the scene. In the past the two would mix (even though shadowmasks should only appear past the max distance of shadowmaps in the scene when Distance Shadowmask is active). Not even this incorrect behavior (which was actually quite useful because it obscured the low-resolution nature of shadowmasks) happens anymore, and the shadowmask replaces all shadows completely.\n\nI've observed this in my own test worlds and in The_Heavynator's worlds.",
